<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>Which part of the equation tells us that Graph C opens downward?</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here: </para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> \(y=1-x^2\) is the equation. The negative coefficient of \(x^2\) makes the graph open downward.</para>
  </solution></exercise></section>
